\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces MuSiQue 2-hop: model size vs.\ accuracy. Stars indicate our results. A 7B model with system architecture (blue star, 60.0\%) exceeds all published methods including StepChain SOTA (43.9\%). Opus + system (purple star, 76.7\%) sets a new high-water mark.}}{7}{figure.caption.8}\protected@file@percent }
