\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces The direction reversal: identical techniques produce opposite effects depending on where they are applied. Query decomposition harms model-level performance ($-12.4\%$, $p=0.0009$) but produces the largest system-level gain ($+46.7\%$).}}{8}{figure.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:reversal}{{3}{8}{The direction reversal: identical techniques produce opposite effects depending on where they are applied. Query decomposition harms model-level performance ($-12.4\%$, $p=0.0009$) but produces the largest system-level gain ($+46.7\%$)}{figure.caption.10}{}}
