\newlabel{fig:frontier}{{4}{9}{System architecture produces consistent gains ($\sim $40--47\% EM) across model scales. Qwen 7B + system ties Sonnet + system (60\%). Opus + system (76.7\%) is the highest result. All exceed StepChain SOTA (43.9\%, dashed line)}{figure.caption.13}{}}
